  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#autofocusing-a-form-control:-the-autofocus-attribute does a bunch of checks in steps 2-8 that are supposed to skip autofocusing.... but then queues a task in step 9.  And by the time that task runs, those conditions from steps 2-8 that are supposed to prevent autofocusing can start to hold.  This seems pretty weird.",
